        children: "sequenceDiagram\n    participant API as RefundResource\n    participant SVC as RefundApplicationService\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL\n    participant PSP as Payment Provider\n    participant WH as Webhook Processor\n    participant OB as Outbox Publisher\n\n    API->>SVC: POST refund with Idempotency-Key\n    SVC->>DB: idempotency begin\n    SVC->>DB: lock payment\n    SVC->>DB: calculate available refundable amount\n    SVC->>DB: insert refund REQUESTED/PROVIDER_PENDING\n    SVC->>DB: insert refund event\n    SVC->>PSP: create refund with provider idempotency key\n    PSP-->>SVC: accepted/succeeded/failed/timeout\n\n    alt provider immediate success\n        SVC->>DB: mark refund SUCCEEDED\n        SVC->>DB: update payment refunded amount\n        SVC->>DB: insert ledger refund\n        SVC->>DB: insert outbox RefundSucceeded\n    else provider accepted async\n        SVC->>DB: mark refund PROVIDER_PENDING\n        SVC->>DB: insert outbox RefundRequested\n    else timeout\n        SVC->>DB: mark refund UNKNOWN\n        SVC->>DB: insert event RefundUnknown\n    end\n\n    PSP-->>WH: refund webhook\n    WH->>DB: inbox dedup\n    WH->>DB: mark refund SUCCEEDED/FAILED\n    WH->>DB: ledger/outbox if success\n    OB->>OB: publish RefundSucceeded/RefundFailed\n"
